[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13980.469, "timestamp": "03:53:00", "text": "需要两到四天，就这么简单。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13982.55, "timestamp": "03:53:02", "text": "每周大概花三天时间。它不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13984.55, "timestamp": "03:53:04", "text": "好的。这不利于你的名誉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13986.79, "timestamp": "03:53:06", "text": "你掉落的速度真快。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13989.189, "timestamp": "03:53:09", "text": "知道如何运用你的英语。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13993.03, "timestamp": "03:53:13", "text": "你明白我的意思吗，雅克先生？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13997.11, "timestamp": "03:53:17", "text": "是的。你可以让他们这么做，仅仅因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13999.269, "timestamp": "03:53:19", "text": "你知道，就因为他们有这种感觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14001.269, "timestamp": "03:53:21", "text": "情况不好并不意味着他们可以休息一天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14003.429, "timestamp": "03:53:23", "text": "一直如此。他们可以休息一天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14006.79, "timestamp": "03:53:26", "text": "但不要太多。所以这不仅仅是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14008.87, "timestamp": "03:53:28", "text": "人们觉得这不仅仅是事实。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14012.63, "timestamp": "03:53:32", "text": "逻辑上，它既是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14015.189, "timestamp": "03:53:35", "text": "你看。这真是太愚蠢了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14016.87, "timestamp": "03:53:36", "text": "问题。我不知道该怎么办"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14020.63, "timestamp": "03:53:40", "text": "它。你可以把中间那个放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14022.63, "timestamp": "03:53:42", "text": "问题是，这就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14024.55, "timestamp": "03:53:44", "text": "针对性问题。这不适合我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14027.99, "timestamp": "03:53:47", "text": "因为问问大家，答案肯定是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14030.229, "timestamp": "03:53:50", "text": "感觉很奇怪，因为这太像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14032.07, "timestamp": "03:53:52", "text": "年轻人提问。这真是太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14034.63, "timestamp": "03:53:54", "text": "年轻人提问。你只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14036.95, "timestamp": "03:53:56", "text": "知道这仅仅是事实和逻辑，还是另有其他因素？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14039.03, "timestamp": "03:53:59", "text": "像这样的情绪，真是太年轻了。"}]